  "question": {
    "text": "A circle is drawn whose centre is on the&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi><mo>–</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> and it touches the&nbsp;<math><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>.</mo></math> If no part of the circle lies outside the parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></math> then the maximum possible radius of the circle is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/a2162237-1c68-44d4-9dd7-34775368794b.png\" style=\"width:2.09722in;height:1.97299in\" /><br />Let equation of circle is&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />Solving it with <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x,</mi></math> we get,<br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> or <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>",
